<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee weaker vs dollar, stable on pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee weaker vs dollar, stable on pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee was fixed weaker against the dollar but was unchanged versus the pound on Monday, commercial banks' forex dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was quoted at a mean commercial rate of 20.692 for a dollar from 20.682 on Friday. Against the pound, the rupee was fixed unchanged from Friday at a mean rate of 32.379.</p>
</text>
